# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated benchmark output.
#
# `make figures` rebuilds all of this from the algorithms on every run, so
# tracking it only produces churn. The canonical figure set that the paper
# links to is kept under experiments/results/paper_figures/ and is regenerated
# deliberately (see REPRODUCE.md), not on every local run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
benchmarks/results/
experiments/results/all_figures/
experiments/results/diagnostics/
experiments/results/paper_figures/*_curved.png
experiments/results/paper_figures/*_hops.png

# Scratch files kept out of the published artifact
guide.html
style.css
output.pdf
image.png
image copy.png
